comments.body:
This looks like it came from #2355, which switched nearest_points in shapely/ops.py from shapely.get_point(seq, 0/1) to shapely.lib.get_point_scalar(seq, 0/1) for speed. shortest_line still returns an array for array input, but the scalar version only accepts a single geometry, hence the TypeError. I can reproduce it on 2.2.0 with plain numpy object arrays too, so it's not GeoPandas-specific, and 2.1.2 returns arrays as before.
Keeping the fast path only for the scalar case fixes it locally:
if isinstance(seq, BaseGeometry):
    return shapely.lib.get_point_scalar(seq, 0), shapely.lib.get_point_scalar(seq, 1)
return shapely.get_point(seq, 0), shapely.get_point(seq, 1)
With that, scalar inputs return points as before, and array or mixed array/scalar inputs return arrays like in 2.1.2.
